  "description": "New, upgraded and spicy, the 2017 Shift R3 levels up from the S3: 4-Bar Linkage frame, Rockshox rear shock, SR Raidon fork with remote lockout, sealed bearing hubs with thru-axles and new Shimano 365 disc brakes. Go into that corner hot, rip the downhill, and cruise the climb. The R3 cuts the flex to ensure precision steering, for a handling that is predictable but never boring. More confidence equals bigger thrills, as the R3's suspension travel smooths out the little bumps, without bottoming out on the big ones.\n6061-T6 alloy Shift R 4-Bar linkage frame, 125mm rear travel w/ 12mm thru-axle dropouts\nFront triangle Internal cable routing\nRockShox Monarch R Solo Air rear shock w/ rebound adjuster\nSuntour Raidon-XC-RLR fork, tapered alloy steerer, 120mm travel, air spring w/ remote lockout\nPivit sealed bearing hubs w/ 15mm & 12mm thru-axles\nSuntour XCM 38/24T crankset w/ 24mm Axle, 10-spd compatible\nShimano Deore 10-spd 11-36T cassette\n2017 Shimano M365 hydraulic brakeset\nWTB Rocket Sport saddle",
